             <tr><td><code>GET /api/repo/&lt;owner&gt;/&lt;repo&gt;/{tree,blob,blobs,raw,history,commit,branches,search}</code></td><td>website browse — proxied over ordinary HTTPS to a healthy authenticated mirror origin</td></tr>
